},{"words":[{"surface":"பெண்கொலை","parts":[{"text":"பெண்","lemma":"பெண்","gloss":"woman"},{"text":"கொலை","lemma":"கொலை","gloss":"killing"}],"gloss":"killing of a woman"},{"surface":"புரிந்த","parts":[{"text":"புரிந்த","lemma":"புரி","gloss":"who committed"}],"gloss":"who committed"},{"surface":"நன்னன்","parts":[{"text":"நன்னன்","lemma":"நன்னன்","gloss":"Nannan"}],"gloss":"Nannan"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வரையா","parts":[{"text":"வரையா","lemma":"வரை","gloss":"boundless"}],"gloss":"boundless"},{"surface":"நிரையத்து","parts":[{"text":"நிரையத்து","lemma":"நிரையத்து","gloss":"to hell"}],"gloss":"to hell","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செலீஇயரோ","parts":[{"text":"செலீஇயரோ","lemma":"செலீஇயரோ","gloss":"may she go!"}],"gloss":"may she go!","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அன்னை","parts":[{"text":"அன்னை","lemma":"அன்னை","gloss":"mother"}],"gloss":"mother"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"நாள்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"day"},{"surface":"நகை","parts":[{"text":"நகை","lemma":"நகை","gloss":"smiling"}],"gloss":"smiling"},{"surface":"முக","parts":[{"text":"முக","lemma":"முக","gloss":"face"}],"gloss":"face","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"விருந்தினன்","parts":[{"text":"விருந்தினன்","lemma":"விருந்தினன்","gloss":"guest"}],"gloss":"guest"},{"surface":"வந்து","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"வா","gloss":"having come"}],"gloss":"having come"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"because"}],"gloss":"because"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பகை","parts":[{"text":"பகை","lemma":"பகை","gloss":"hostile"}],"gloss":"hostile"},{"surface":"முக","parts":[{"text":"முக","lemma":"முக","gloss":"face"}],"gloss":"face","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஊரின்","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like the town"},{"surface":"துஞ்சல்","parts":[{"text":"துஞ்சு","lemma":"துஞ்சு","gloss":"sleep"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"sleeping"},{"surface":"ஓ","parts":[{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"இலளே","parts":[{"text":"இலள்","lemma":"இலள்","gloss":"she does not do"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"she does not do"}]}],"literal":"The bright-foreheaded young woman who went to bathe, / for her transgression of eating a green fruit brought by the stream, / even when ninety male elephants and her weight / in a gold-made doll were offered, not accepting, / like Nannan who committed the murder of a woman, / may mother go to the boundless hell! / Just because a smiling-faced guest came for one day, / like a hostile-faced town, she does not sleep at all.","translation":"May mother go to boundless hell, just like Nannan who committed the murder of a woman, refusing to accept even when offered ninety male elephants and a life-sized doll made of gold equal to her weight, all for the transgression of a bright-foreheaded young woman who went to bathe and ate a green fruit brought down by the stream! Just because a smiling-faced guest came for a single day, mother does not sleep at all, keeping watch like a hostile town.","modern":"நீராடச் சென்ற ஒளிபொருந்திய நெற்றியையுடைய ஒரு பெண், ஆற்று நீர் அடித்துக் கொண்டு வந்த பச்சைக் காயைத் தின்ற குற்றத்திற்காக, அவளது எடைக்கு நிகரான பொன்னால் செய்த பாவையையும் தொண்ணூறு ஆண் யானைகளையும் இழப்பீடாகக் கொடுத்தும் ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளாமல் அவளைக் கொலை செய்த நன்னனைப் போல, என் தாய் எல்லையற்ற நரகத்திற்குச் செல்வாளாக! ஒரு நாள் புன்னகை முகத்துடன் விருந்தினனாகத் தலைவன் வந்தான் என்பதற்காக, பகைமை நிறைந்த ஊரைப் போல அவள் சிறிதும் உறங்காமல் விழித்துக் கொண்டிருக்கிறாளே!","explanation":"The foster-mother is keeping a strict watch over the heroine, preventing her from meeting her lover. The friend speaks to herself or to the heroine, expressing her anger at the mother's sleepless vigilance. She compares the mother to the infamous king Nannan, who executed a young girl for eating a green mango that floated down his royal stream, refusing all compensation offered by her family. The friend curses the mother to go to boundless hell for her cruelty in keeping the heroine confined. The 'smiling-faced guest' refers to the hero who visited, and because of his brief visit, the mother has become as alert and hostile as a town on guard against enemies, refusing to sleep.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.25],[1.25,1.5],[1.5,2.5],[2.5,2.9],[2.9,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,4.05],[4.05,5.3],[5.3,5.53],[5.53,6.2],[6.2,7.2],[7.2,7.3],[7.3,8.1],[8.1,8.4],[8.4,9.2],[9.2,9.3],[9.3,9.7],[9.7,10.0],[10.0,10.0],[10.0,11.56],[11.56,12.3],[12.3,12.6],[12.6,13.7],[13.7,13.9],[13.9,14.4],[14.4,15.3],[15.3,16.1],[16.1,16.2],[16.2,16.8],[17.1,17.25]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.43],[1.43,1.7],[1.7,3.16],[3.16,3.32],[3.32,4.4],[4.4,4.67],[4.67,4.67],[4.67,6.0],[6.0,6.23],[6.23,7.1],[7.1,7.8],[8.08,8.5],[8.5,9.1],[9.1,9.6],[9.6,10.4],[10.4,10.4],[10.4,10.9],[10.9,11.2],[11.2,12.5],[12.5,13.7],[13.7,13.7],[13.7,14.0],[14.0,15.2],[15.2,15.5],[15.5,15.9],[15.9,16.9],[16.9,17.8],[17.8,17.9],[17.9,18.48],[18.91,19.2]]},"sync":[[["மண்ணிய","having bathed"]],[["சென்ற","who went"]],[["ஒண்ணுதல்","bright forehead"]],[["ஒண்ணுதல்","bright forehead"],["அரிவை","young woman"]],[["புனல்","stream"],["தரு","brought"]],[["பசுங்காய்","green fruit"]],[["தின்றதன்","of eating that"]],[["தப்பல்","transgression"]],[["கொன்பதிற்",""]],[["றொன்பது",""]],[["களிற்றொ",""]],[["டவணிறை",""]],[["பொன்","gold"],["செய்","made"]],[["பாவை","doll"]],[["கொடுப்பவும்","even when given"]],[["கொள்ளான்","he did not accept"]],[["பெண்கொலை","killing of a woman"]],[["புரிந்த","who committed"]],[["நன்னன்","Nannan"]],[["போல","like"]],[["வரையா","boundless"]],[["நிரையத்து","to hell"],["செலீஇயரோ","may she go!"]],[["செலீஇயரோ","may she go!"]],[["அன்னை","mother"]],[["ஒரு","one"],["நாள்","day"]],[["நகை","smiling"],["முக","face"]],[["விருந்தினன்","guest"]],[["வந்து","having come"],["என","because"]],[["பகை","hostile"],["முக","face"]],[["ஊரின்","like the town"]],[["துஞ்சல்","sleeping"]],[["இலளே","she does not do"]]]}